{"id":"632946","name":"荞麦馒头","author":"どら","authorId":"10454906","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/632946/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"荞麦粉","amount":"50克"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"300克"},{"name":"温水","amount":"100克"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"20克"}],"sub":[{"name":"酵母","amount":"5克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"克荞麦粉加25克白糖。","img":"images/632946/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入5克酵母，温水100克拌均匀。","img":"images/632946/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"鸡蛋两个。","img":"images/632946/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"继续加入低粉300克。","img":"images/632946/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"揉成光滑面团。","img":"images/632946/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"盖上湿布，然后大家两倍大。","img":"images/632946/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"揉成馒头胚子，放入纸托，盖上锅盖，发酵两倍大，大火蒸20分钟焖2分钟。","img":"images/632946/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"出锅，成品。","img":"images/632946/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"早餐吃了吗。","img":"images/632946/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}